## Why This Is Asked

Tests cross-region DR planning using ECS, Route 53 and ALB. It ensures knowledge of multi-region deployments, traffic shifting, and automated rollback.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-region ECS Fargate deployments
- Route 53 weighted routing
- Separate ALB/TargetGroup per region
- Automated rollback criteria and CodePipeline integration
- Observability for DR thresholds

